<pb facs="1038309" n="131v"/>
  <opener><salute><lb/>Vir Excllme, Fautor Honoratissime.</salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Accepit heri <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> meus <rs key="B_991170515020105501" type="letter">literas</rs> Tuas 21. Julii scriptas sibi <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs type="person">mercatore</rs>
      <lb/>quodam nostrate traditus, ex quibus Te frustra hactenus <rs key="B_991170515020105501" type="letter">literas</rs>
      <lb/>nostras expectasse <add>tristes</add> intellegimus. Binas ad Te <subst><del><gap/></del><add>de<unclear>d</unclear>imus</add></subst> <rs key="B_991170517053705501" type="letter">epistolas</rs> uterque
      <lb/>nostrum, quarum posteriores 18. Julii <del><unclear>tri<gap/>loqui</unclear></del>scriptas per
      <lb/><rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-2775220" type="place">Oenipontum</rs> transmisimus, quoniam altera via per
<pb facs="1038310" n="132r"/>
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergomum</rs> minus tuta esse nobis vide<del>ba</del>tur, id quod partim ex eo suspica<del><unclear>tum</unclear></del><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mur, quod jam in prioribus Tuis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053505501">literis</rs> questus fueras, quod nullas <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> nobis acce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>peris literas, partim ex eo quod nobis nuntiatum fuit, magnas intercedere
      <lb/>lites postarum nostrarum directoribus cum<del>  directoribus post</del> Mediolanensibus,
      <lb/>qui s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>pissime literas nostras per plures menses <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolani</rs> detinent, ubi etiam
      <lb/>priores nostr<subst><del><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></del><add>as</add></subst> <rs key="B_991170517053905501" type="letter">epistol<subst><del><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></del><add>as</add></subst></rs> <unclear>15</unclear>. Maji ad te script<subst><del><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></del><add>as</add></subst>, nisi Tibi jam tradit<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sint,
      <lb/> <subst><del><unclear>ass<gap/><add>detineri</add>credo.</unclear></del><add>adhuc latere credo</add></subst>. Verum quoniam citam responsionem desideras, <del>merc</del>et merca<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tor qui Tuas nobis tradidit instat ut responsionem per hodiernum cursorem
      <lb/>mittamus, Patruus autem ob varia negotia tam cito <del>rescribere</del>ad Tuas respon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere non possit, visum est nobis <del><choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> re</del>non male<supplied> </supplied>nos facturos, si apographum
      <lb/>earum <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053705501">literarum</rs>, quas <date when="1714-07-18">18. Julij</date> ad Te per <rs type="place" key="place_VER-tirola">Tyrolim</rs> misimus, huic cursori
      <lb/><del>add Te</del>transferendum daremus, ut saltem per alterutram viam rerum
      <lb/>earum exemplar ad Te perveniat. En igitur meas <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053705501">literas</rs> <date when="1714-07-18">18. Julij scriptas</date>:</p>
  <closer><dateline><lb/>Ex <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053705501">literis</rs> Tuis <abbr><choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice>c.</abbr> 8. Augusti 1714</dateline>.</closer>
  <postscript><p><abbr>P. S.</abbr> Nondum accepi exemplaria Libri
        <lb/><abbr>Dni</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">De Monmort</rs> ex <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Gallia</rs> mihi apportanda, quamprimum ea accepero, <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_69NKSR46">fascicu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lum pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dictum</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergomum</rs> transmittam.</p></postscript>

</div></body></text></TEI>
